  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Above Crescent Lake the three stand as a set: Fairy Qing Suo is a cold looking blue robed immortal, Fairy Huang Sha is a petite fair girl in a yellow garment, and Fairy Fen Meng is a coquettish girl in a pink skirt.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Gui Wang plans to barge into Lang Ya Blessed Land with Loner Hong Yu, he says he has asked the Hua Hai three immortals to help. Loner Hong Yu is shocked that the righteous path’s Hua Hai three immortals agreed. Gui Wang answers that righteous and demonic labels give way to personal interest, and that Lang Ya’s countless recipes move the three.",
      "chapters": [
        446
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recruited-against-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gui_wang",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_loner_hong_yu",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later names the same trio, with Loner Hong Yu, as allies he can gather against Lang Ya because of promised benefits, while saying he lacks chips to aim them at Zi Du blessed land as well.",
      "chapters": [
        448
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recruited-against-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_zi_du_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Above Crescent Lake, three female Gu Immortals stand with Gui Wang and Loner Hong Yu: Fairy Qing Suo in blue, Fairy Huang Sha in yellow, and Fairy Fen Meng in pink. They keep distance from the two demonic path Gu Immortals, yet Immortal Gu recipes in Lang Ya are enough for them to set aside righteous path identity and collaborate. Watching Endless Thunder and Lightning Rain, they say that if the same struck their Hua Hai Blessed Land, even the three sisters joining forces might not resist it. After Gui Wang and Loner Hong Yu rush the emptied entrance, the three follow into Lang Ya and then fly separately toward three cloud buildings.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-at-crescent-lake",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crescent_lake",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fairy_qing_suo",
        "char_fairy_huang_sha",
        "char_fairy_fen_meng",
        "sys_gu_recipe",
        "loc_hua_hai_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the Gu Immortal captives Fang Yuan sees in Lang Ya are the three Hua Hai immortals, Loner Hong Yu, and Gui Wang.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captives-in-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a later auction he still holds four captives: Rushing Thunder Hand Wu Hao and the three Hua Hai immortals, who cultivate wood path. Heavenly Lord Bai Zu puts the three into a bid, and the wood path seller takes that offer while Fang Yuan obtains Unravel Mystery Immortal Gu in the three-party trade.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wood-path-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_hao",
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu",
        "gu_unravel_mystery"
      ]
    }
  ],
